 Sextant Protocol – Reference Architecture (v1.0)

## 1. Purpose

This document defines the Sextant Protocol as a **layered reference architecture** for modelling:

- AI-driven infrastructure dependencies  
- cascading system failures  
- observability limitations in complex distributed systems  
- cross-domain system coupling risks  

It provides a simplified structural view of the system for evaluation, analysis, and research alignment.

This is a **modelling framework only** and does not operate live infrastructure systems.

